# The build-script refresh sentinel, which nothing reads any more: every provider refreshes from
# `certval-store-gen` and `refresh.yml`, and the one build script left (`certval_stores_msft`)
# verifies its committed material unconditionally. Kept so that a leftover file in an old working
# tree cannot be committed. The providers' `include` lists keep it out of a package.
refresh-inputs
